/// Re-export of hk's configuration schema that this package's builtins are
/// written against.
///
/// The import below is the schema pin: builtins import this module instead of
/// repeating the version. A module that needs an hk builtin, such as
/// `Hooks.pkl`, imports hk's `Builtins.pkl` at that same version, and
/// `tests/test_pins.py` fails when a file names another one. Consumers amend
/// this module, or amend hk's `Config.pkl` at the same version: `Config.Step`
/// objects built from a different hk version are different types.
module hk_config.Config

amends "package://github.com/jdx/hk/releases/download/v2.11.1/hk@2.11.1#/Config.pkl"
